{
  "description": "Scheme-2 signature vectors, one set per label. key = HKDF-SHA256(ikm=secret UTF-8, salt=b'emporiqa-v2', info=label + ':' + store_id, length=32); signature = lowercase hex HMAC-SHA256(key, str(t) + '.' + message UTF-8 bytes). message is body for 'plugin-to-emporiqa' (header X-Emporiqa-Webhook-Signature) and 'emporiqa-to-plugin' (X-Emporiqa-Action-Signature), and request_id + '.' + body for 'response' (X-Emporiqa-Response-Signature). Header: t=<t>,v1=<signature>.",
  "salt": "emporiqa-v2",
  "vectors": [
