  "description_negative": "Each negative vector must be REFUSED when verified at time `now` with its secret and store_id, by Emporiqa's verifier of plugin-to-emporiqa webhooks. Cases marked single_v1_only are refused because that verifier takes exactly one v1; a verifier of Emporiqa's own signatures (emporiqa-to-plugin) must ACCEPT several v1 values, so it skips them and checks rotation_vectors instead. A plugin's verifier test can assert the same.",
